[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3542.43, "timestamp": "00:59:02", "text": "它？不，哥哥睡着了。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3545.75, "timestamp": "00:59:05", "text": "上帝。不，阿斯特拉，你几点睡的？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3548.349, "timestamp": "00:59:08", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Ayoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3550.069, "timestamp": "00:59:10", "text": "我的天啊。他要么在睡觉，要么就只是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3552.519, "timestamp": "00:59:12", "author": "@OtakuArceus", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/VSZC0x7e02-tCAnte525GcpFOF0YcSpYQWplJkdg1RARvkQA3ETFxFaiYVshpLrqHFKUMz4VmA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bro was with me"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3552.87, "timestamp": "00:59:12", "text": "很忙，而且他的肩膀像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3554.789, "timestamp": "00:59:14", "text": "出事了。所以我觉得"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3557.615, "timestamp": "00:59:17", "author": "@OtakuArceus", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/VSZC0x7e02-tCAnte525GcpFOF0YcSpYQWplJkdg1RARvkQA3ETFxFaiYVshpLrqHFKUMz4VmA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3558.309, "timestamp": "00:59:18", "text": "正因为如此，它就像是把东西塞进……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3559.75, "timestamp": "00:59:19", "text": "他僵硬得像块石头，而他的一切……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3562.549, "timestamp": "00:59:22", "text": "他说，哦不，我兄弟当时和我在一起。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3565.558, "timestamp": "00:59:25", "author": "@OtakuArceus", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/VSZC0x7e02-tCAnte525GcpFOF0YcSpYQWplJkdg1RARvkQA3ETFxFaiYVshpLrqHFKUMz4VmA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i kept him safe"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3566.23, "timestamp": "00:59:26", "text": "不，兄弟，他这是在夺走我们的朋友。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3568.838, "timestamp": "00:59:28", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Yeah my shoulder is fixed"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3577.381, "timestamp": "00:59:37", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I am back to business baby "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3581.109, "timestamp": "00:59:41", "text": "终于有好消息了。那挺好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3583.119, "timestamp": "00:59:43", "text": "那挺好的。 他肯定要挨一​​顿狠训。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3585.92, "timestamp": "00:59:45", "text": "他肯定要挨一​​顿狠训。 我说的就是我，伙计。他干了些蠢事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3590.28, "timestamp": "00:59:50", "text": "我说的就是我，伙计。他干了些蠢事 在那堵封闭的高墙之内，我将……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3594.0, "timestamp": "00:59:54", "text": "在那堵封闭的高墙之内，我将…… 比如当面质问他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3596.04, "timestamp": "00:59:56", "text": "比如当面质问他 现在。我说得对吗，闺蜜？我是谁？"}]